zh:
顶点附近的局部行为。固定 $k$，把其余因子在 $x_k$ 处展开：$$ egin{aligned}\prod_{j
e k}(\zeta-x_j)^{\alpha_j-1}&=c_k+O(\zeta-x_k),\c_k&=\prod_{j
e k}(x_k-x_j)^{\alpha_j-1}
e0.\end{aligned}$$ 于是被积函数等于 $C c_k(\zeta-x_k)^{\alpha_k-1}(1+O(\zeta-x_k))$，从 $x_k$ 积分得 $$f(z)-w_k= rac{C c_k}{\alpha_k}(z-x_k)^{\alpha_k}\left(1+O(z-x_k)ight).$$ 当 $z$ 从上半平面趋于 $x_k$ 时，$\arg(z-x_k)$ 在 $(0,\pi)$ 内变化，故 $f(z)-w_k$ 的辐角扫过 $\alpha_k\pi$：源点处的平角 $\pi$ 被乘成多边形的内角 $\alpha_k\pi$。这就是积分中指数必须取 $\alpha_k-1$（积分后升一次）的原因。又 $f'(z)=C\prod_{k=1}^{n}(z-x_k)^{\alpha_k-1}
e0$（$z\in\mathbb H$），故 $f$ 局部共形；在顶点附近 $|f'|\sim|z-x_k|^{\alpha_k-1}$，凸顶点（$\alpha_k<1$）导数发散，凹顶点（$\alpha_k>1$）导数为零。

en:
Local behaviour at a vertex. Fix $k$ and expand the other factors at $x_k$: $$ egin{aligned}\prod_{j
e k}(\zeta-x_j)^{\alpha_j-1}&=c_k+O(\zeta-x_k),\c_k&=\prod_{j
e k}(x_k-x_j)^{\alpha_j-1}
e0.\end{aligned}$$ Hence the integrand equals $C c_k(\zeta-x_k)^{\alpha_k-1}(1+O(\zeta-x_k))$, and integrating from $x_k$ gives $$f(z)-w_k= rac{C c_k}{\alpha_k}(z-x_k)^{\alpha_k}\left(1+O(z-x_k)ight).$$ As $z$ approaches $x_k$ from the upper half-plane, $\arg(z-x_k)$ varies in $(0,\pi)$, so the argument of $f(z)-w_k$ sweeps out an angle $\alpha_k\pi$: the straight angle $\pi$ at the source point is multiplied into the interior angle $\alpha_k\pi$. This is why the exponent in the integrand is $\alpha_k-1$ (integration raises it by one). Also $f'(z)=C\prod_{k=1}^{n}(z-x_k)^{\alpha_k-1}
e0$ on $\mathbb H$, so $f$ is locally conformal; near the vertex $|f'|\sim|z-x_k|^{\alpha_k-1}$, which blows up at a convex vertex ($\alpha_k<1$) and vanishes at a reflex vertex ($\alpha_k>1$).
